ns and armour with unique attachments. Nrvesk’s life lay in his companions’ hands; shape them to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027380/extras/ffd9bd95e83f883fbc8487a89ac3eb18.avif?t=1759157447\" width=800 height=367 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating enemies, aiding strangers, and trading with merchants are your means of sustaining yourself on this journey. Balance your resources, between unlocking new traits and abilities, upgrading your equipment, and sustaining your companions. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027380/extras/9f8b26ca7e3ca638340e6a20471c5c2e.poster.avif?t=1759157447\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027380/extras/9f8b26ca7e3ca638340e6a20471c5c2e.webm?t=1759157447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027380/extras/9f8b26ca7e3ca638340e6a20471c5c2e.mp4?t=1759157447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat rears its head at every turn in <i>Lost In The Open</i>. Prepare for the worst. Face the consequences of your choices. Return to your throne.</p>",
        "short_description": "An unexpected assassination attempt leaves you wounded and fleeing across no man's land. To survive in this roguelike, low-fantasy tactical RPG, you must recruit strategically, fight desperately and repent sincerely.",
